OL,3,GNEWSAHospital care co-ordination centre
OL,4,Agets approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning permission has been granted
OL,7,Ffor a new #7.5m hospital care
OL,8,Fco-ordination centre, which bosses say
OL,9,Fwill reduce waiting times and improve
OL,10,Fpatient care.
OL,12,FThe building at Hull Royal Infirmary
OL,13,Fwill include a new patient discharge
OL,14,Flounge for people who are fit to leave
OL,15,Fhospital, but are waiting for
OL,16,Fmedication or transport.
OL,18,FThe NHS Humber Health Partnership said
OL,19,Fthe main aim of the site was to help
OL,20,Ffree up space within the main building
OL,21,Fto create more acute clinical areas.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
