OL,3,GNEWSAHospital care co-ordination centre
OL,4,Agets approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction is due to start in
OL,7,FSeptember and is expected to be
OL,8,Fcompleted in autumn 2027, the trust
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
